WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.870
A family of seven.

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:07.060
Mr and Mrs Bennet, and five
daughters, from Jane down to Lydia.

3
00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.640
Then Brighton, a seaside
camp full of officers.

4
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.050
And the youngest circle rolls away,
beside an officer called Wickham.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.020
She leaves a letter behind:
"What a good joke it will be!"

6
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:19.850
Lydia?

7
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:20.660
Wickham?

8
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.380
Someone else entirely?

9
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.090
Who is to blame?

10
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.950
In this mission, you'll get
to know the Bennet family,

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.630
and look closely at the parents' marriage.

12
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.330
You'll follow the
elopement, letter by letter,

13
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.860
and see how its disgrace
spreads to the whole family.

14
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.300
And you'll weigh up the
evidence, one person at a time.

15
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.260
Your mission: decide who is to blame.
